Kaden], with early EPs appearing on the Jena label [l=Freude am Tanzen]. As a solo artist he became closely linked to labels including Vakant, Freude am Tanzen, Rekids, Desolat, Watergate Records, Pets Recordings, Diynamic and Ovum Recordings. His debut album, Studio 10, was released on [l=Vakant] in 2009, followed by further albums including Energetic and work under his dub-influenced alias [a=Mathimidori].\n\nKaden is also connected to the project [a=Karocel], formed with [a=Marbert Rocel] and percussionist [a=Michael Nagler] for a live set at Nachtdigital in 2010. In 2014 he created [l=Muna Musik], a label connected to the Muna club, beginning with the 20 Jahre Muna compilation. ","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:308684","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":2158240,"name":"Mathimidori"},{"id":2570853,"name":"Mathy K & The Funky Punch"}],"groups":[{"active":true,"id":125628,"name":"Hemmann & Kaden"},{"active":true,"id":2796353,"name":"Stefanikaden"},{"active":true,"id":3241059,"name":"Karocel"}],"members":null,"namevariations":["Kaden","Kaden, Mathias","M. Kaden","Mathias"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/308684-Mathias-Kaden","type":"artist","urls":["http://www.mathiaskaden.de","http://mathiaskaden.bandcamp.com","http://www.facebook.com/mathiaskaden","http://www.soundcloud.com/mathiaskaden","http://www.myspace.com/mathiaskaden","https://www.instagram.com/mathiaskaden/"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/4454785/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"4454785","image":"","imageThumb":"","profile":"American record producer, singer-songwriter and audio engineer.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:4454785","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":3270639,"name":"Cam (19)"},{"id":4225360,"name":"Cameron Osteen"}],"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariations":["Cam Obi"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/4454785-Cam-Obi","type":"artist","urls":["https://www.facebook.com/iamcamobi/","https://www.instagram.com/camobi/","